# Decision records

One file per call that a future-you would not reconstruct from the code.

## Format

```markdown
# NNN — short title

- **Status:** accepted | proposed | superseded
- **Date:** YYYY-MM-DD
- **Context:** why this came up
- **Decision:** what we chose
- **Consequences:** what follows, including what we rejected
```

Number sequentially. Do not rewrite history; supersede with a new record.

